<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said analyst Todd Jordan downgraded Harrah's Entertainment Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 16-1/4.</p>
</text>
